# C style for the native shim (src/c/*.c). Copied VERBATIM from the upstream
# Pebble firmware repo (coredevices/PebbleOS `main` → .clang-format) so our
# native code matches Pebble's own conventions exactly, not an approximation.
# Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/coredevices/PebbleOS/main/.clang-format
---
BasedOnStyle: Google
IndentWidth: 2
UseTab: Never
PointerAlignment: Right
ColumnLimit: 100
SortIncludes: Never
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Empty
---
